# Static-analysis policy for the Qt test translation units.
#
# Inherits the repository policy and removes one check that cannot be satisfied
# here. A Qt test case is a private slot invoked through the meta-object system,
# which cannot invoke a static member function. Converting one as suggested
# removes the case from the run while leaving the file compiling and the suite
# green, so the advice is not merely noisy here but actively unsafe.
#
# This exclusion is scoped to this directory. The same check stays enabled for
# application and core sources, where its advice is sound.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-convert-member-functions-to-static
